                                "sense_id": "2357af76-6d38-3c07-86fd-6eb1a3e28798",
                                "text": "Gefangenen Partisanen wurde kein Pardon gegeben; sie wurden sofort standrechtlich erschossen.",
                                "translation": "Captured partisans were given no quarter, but were immediately subjected to summary execution.",
                                "english": "Captured partisans were given no quarter, but were immediately subjected to summary execution."
                            }
